## Tests

```sh
python3 .scripts/tests/run.py
python3 -m unittest discover -s .scripts/tests -p 'test_*.py'
```

| Fixture | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `tests/fixtures/good` | Must lint completely clean (includes Dataview lambdas/aliases, `~~~` fences, a file with no trailing newline, a Templater template) |
| `tests/fixtures/bad` | Must trip every check (includes CRLF, BOM and Latin-1 files) |
| `tests/fixtures/fix` + `fix-expected` | `--fix` output, idempotency, body preservation |
| `tests/fixtures/review` | `--review` sections, run with `--today 2026-09-26` |

Symlinks, a 2.7 MB note, concurrent-edit protection, git-based staleness and the
audit regressions (`AuditRegressions`: `_tmp/` skipping, Archive fields, template
type, and more) are built in temp folders at test time. Pass `--today YYYY-MM-DD` and `--root DIR`
to reproduce any run.
